  "sourceTitle": "Minted Egg Salad Tea Sandwiches",
  "sourceText": "Minted Egg Salad Tea Sandwiches\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Tuesday, December 8, 2009 - 11:18pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 hard boiled eggs\n1/4 cup mayonnaise\n1 tablespoon fresh chopped mint leaves\n1/2 teaspoon celery salt\n1/2 teaspoon dry mustard\nWhite salt\n8 thin slices bread, crusts removed\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Chop eggs coarsely.  2 Combine eggs, mayonnaise, mint, celery salt, dry mustard, and salt.  Spread between bread.  3 Remove crusts and cut into desired shapes.",
